    "“%@” is removed from your library and the saved login for %@ is forgotten, unless another source still uses that server. Nothing on the server is deleted." : {
      "comment" : "A warning message that appears when a user is about to remove a source. The first argument is the name of the source. The second argument is the hostname of the source.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "“%1$@” is removed from your library and the saved login for %2$@ is forgotten, unless another source still uses that server. Nothing on the server is deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
